Significance: minor
Type: changed

Paint the chart grid, axis line, tick marks and tick labels from CSS, so an `--a8c-charts-color-grid`, `-axis`, `-tick` or `-label-axis` override set on a chart's own element applies to it and follows a theme change with no re-render. Deprecate the `theme` colors these replace — `gridStyles.stroke`, `xAxisLineStyles.stroke`, `xTickLineStyles.stroke`, `svgLabelSmall.fill` and `backgroundColor` — which still work; prefer the CSS roles.
